Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 19:50:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(interaction): mirror shield use into Bedrock sneak input

Bedrock shields block while sneaking, but Java raises a shield with the use key. Track shield use separately from physical crouch and carry its effective sneak state through each auth input frame. Preserve physical crouch for dismount handling, and stop the synthetic state when use ends or the held shield changes.
